<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: #f4f6fb;
        }

        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.10);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            border-radius: 14px;
            border: 1px solid var(--Natural-10, #FFF);
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #083122 0%, #035335 50%, #083122 100%);
            box-shadow: -1px 4px 24px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24);
            padding: 32px 0 16px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .logo {
            max-width: 160px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 32px 24px 24px 24px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #2e8b57;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        p {
            margin: 0 0 14px;
            color: #444;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .cta-wrapper {
            margin: 26px 0 22px;
        }

        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            text-decoration: none;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #083122 0%, #035335 50%, #083122 100%);
            color: #ffffff !important;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 15px;
            padding: 12px 22px;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .footer {
            background: #f2f6f9;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 24px 10px;
            color: #888;
            font-size: 13px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e0e6ed;
        }

        @media (max-width: 650px) {
            .email-container {
                margin: 10px;
            }

            .content {
                padding: 16px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="header">
            <a href="{{FRONTEND_URL}}">
                <img src="{{host}}/public/images/logo.png" alt="VapeHub Logo" class="logo" />
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <h2>Did you forget something?</h2>
            <p style="font-size:16px; color:#222;">Hi {{customerName}},</p>
            <p>It looks like you left something behind.</p>
            <p>Your items are still waiting in your cart, and you are just a few clicks away from completing your purchase. We have saved everything for you so you can pick up right where you left off.</p>
            <p>Click below to continue your checkout:</p>

            <div class="cta-wrapper">
                <a class="cta-button" href="{{ctaUrl}}">Complete Your Purchase</a>
            </div>

            <p>If you need any help or have questions, simply reply to this email - our customer support team is happy to assist you.</p>
            <p>Kind regards,<br />The Team at <a href="{{FRONTEND_URL}}" style="color: #2e8b57; text-decoration: none;">VapeHub.co.uk</a></p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Customer Support: <a href="mailto:customerservices@vapehub.co.uk" style="color: #2e8b57;">customerservices@vapehub.co.uk</a></p>
            <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} VapeHub. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
